OL,3,GNEWSACharity makes neutering plea after
OL,4,Acat intake surges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity has urged cat owners
OL,7,Fto get their pets neutered after it was
OL,8,Fforced to pause its intake of pregnant
OL,9,Fcats and kittens.
OL,11,FLeicester Animal Aid said its cattery
OL,12,Fin Huncote had been at the "very limit"
OL,13,Fwith 54 animals under their care in the
OL,14,Fweek starting 3 August.
OL,16,FA charity spokesperson said it had seen
OL,17,Fa "surge" in un-neutered animals coming
OL,18,Finto their centre and had paused the
OL,19,Fintake of cats for three weeks.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
