OL,3,GNEWSACharity makes neutering plea after
OL,4,Acat intake surges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Stevenson, kennel and cattery
OL,7,Fmanager at the charity, said it was
OL,8,Fimportant for owners to be aware that
OL,9,Fcats need to be neutered before being
OL,10,Fallowed to venture outside and that
OL,11,Fthere was a "lack of knowledge" about
OL,12,Fthe issue.
